Package: ti-adas-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: TI vision_apps RTOS firmware for j784s4-evm
 Pre-built RTOS firmware images for the heterogeneous cores on the TI
 J784S4 SoC: six R5F MCU cores and four C7x DSP cores.  These firmware
 images implement the RTOS side of the vision_apps OpenVX framework and
 must be loaded by the Linux remoteproc driver before any vision_apps or
 EdgeAI workloads can run.
 .
 Firmware files are installed to /usr/lib/firmware/vision_apps_evm/ and
 update-alternatives symlinks are created at /usr/lib/firmware/ under the
 canonical remoteproc names (e.g. j784s4-main-r5f0_0-fw, j784s4-c71_0-fw).
 .
 Both unsigned (.out) and signed (.out.signed) variants are included.
 The -sec symlinks reference the signed binaries.
 .
 Corresponds to: ti-adas-firmware (Yocto meta-edgeai, PSDK Analytics 11.02).
